# Code owners for DSEgrp18/Web-Page.
#
# Every entry must be a GitHub user with write access to this repository, or the
# rule is silently ignored. The three usernames below were read from the
# repository's own collaborator list, not guessed.
#
# GitHub applies the LAST matching rule for a path, so the specific rules at the
# bottom of this file override the repository-wide default at the top.
#
# A pull request author's own approval never satisfies code owner review, so
# with the default rule below every change still needs a review from one of the
# other two team members.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository default: any of the three team members may review any change.
#
# CLAUDE.md asks for ownership split by area (frontend/accessibility,
# backend/document processing, inference/operations) with a primary and a backup
# reviewer. That split is a team decision and the areas do not exist in the
# repository yet, so it is deliberately not invented here. Replace this default
# with the per-area rules below once the team has agreed who owns what and the
# corresponding directories exist.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*                           @heshannethmina @KusalPabasara @LasanaPahanga

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Planned per-area ownership. Uncomment and assign as each area lands.
# Keep a primary and a backup reviewer on every line.
#
