# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Owner review required for sensitive infrastructure.
#
# CLAUDE.md requires workflow, deployment, and sensitive infrastructure changes
# to be reviewed by the responsible human owner. A malicious or careless change
# to a workflow file can exfiltrate secrets or weaken every other control in
# this repository, so these paths do not fall back to the team-wide default.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
